List the names of the programs that are:
```sql
SELECT name FROM programs WHERE status = 'at_risk';
```

How many milestones are late?:
```sql
SELECT COUNT(*) AS late_milestones FROM milestones WHERE status = 'late';
```

How many employees are there in each bus:
```sql
SELECT business_unit, COUNT(*) AS employees FROM employees GROUP BY business_unit;
```

How many programs are there?:
```sql
SELECT COUNT(*) AS program_count FROM programs;
```

What is the average salary per business:
```sql
SELECT business_unit, AVG(salary_usd) AS avg_salary FROM employees GROUP BY business_unit;
```

Show me the CREATE TABLE statements for:
```sql
SELECT sql FROM sqlite_master WHERE type = 'table';
```

Who are the three best-paid people in Ca:
```sql
SELECT name, "salary_usd" FROM employees ORDER BY "salary_usd" DESC LIMIT 3;
```
